# Production builds (npm run build) call the API at the page's own
# address: service.py serves this built app itself (FRONTEND_DIR), and
# only one address lets Easy Auth's sign-in reach the API - see
# CLAUDE.md, "One address for the page and the API".
# A VITE_API_BASE_URL set in the build environment (e.g. by a pipeline
# still deploying the page as its own app) takes precedence over this.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
